<title>UK: Xavier suspends shares pending announcement.</title>
<headline>Xavier suspends shares pending announcement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Xavier Computer Group said on Wednesday that trading in its shares had been suspended on the secondary AIM market in London &quot;pending an announcement&quot;.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
